text.figure:
ALGORITHM 1: Uncooperative training for multiview image style
translation
Input: Unpaired real HMC images {H t
i } and real rendered images
{R s
i }, in two common views i ∈ {0, 1}.
Output: Converged F ϕ and G ψ
Initialize parameters in all modules;
repeat
Sample (t, s) to get H t
i , R s
i for i ∈ {0, 1} (total 4 images) ;
Update ϕ for F using gradients minimizing L C H + L G H + L V H ;
Update ψ for G using gradients minimizing L C R + L G R + L V R ;
Update P using gradients minimizing L P ;
Update D H and D R using gradients maximizing L G
until converged;
